Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.52,0:00:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a loving feeling that's\Nplaying with rage. I've
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.32,0:00:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Learned a reason that the\Nday we play in a dark secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.24,0:00:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The hopeful thing is that\Nthe end of the coming future.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.02,0:00:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We target the world's\Nlife and the last day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.82,0:00:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be a challenge. So yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.60,0:01:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind the end of the cause. What\NI need to do is break it and walk
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.12,0:01:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Woah, woah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.18,0:01:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The world will try to go to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.38,0:01:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The world. I want to die when I die. I am
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.74,0:01:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,going
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.16,0:01:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.07,0:01:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Die. The
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.99,0:01:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,first time you take the time
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.16,0:01:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.72,0:01:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This story is best told\Nfrom the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.76,0:01:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It was 1965, and a storm\Nraged both outside and within.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.00,0:01:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Prisoner 696, what's going on back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.78,0:01:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's the problem, 696?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.58,0:01:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't end up agreeing with ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.34,0:01:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Girlie's pregnant?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.78,0:01:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We're a remote women's prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.84,0:02:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Our security is top-notch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.96,0:02:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No guy could get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.22,0:02:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, when did it happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.86,0:02:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,She's here for eight years\Nfor robbery and assault.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.64,0:02:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And she's two wins, so this\Ndoesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.76,0:02:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Neither of you know when this happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.68,0:02:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There wasn't so much as\Na bump this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.00,0:02:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.02,0:02:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to talk, chickie.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.72,0:02:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's the kid's daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.10,0:02:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Get a knock-up yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.00,0:02:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The father is dead already!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.96,0:02:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Over two years ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.96,0:02:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.87,0:02:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.38,0:02:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I got something I want to\Nshare with you too, lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.06,0:02:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all the barnacles grown in my knee.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.10,0:02:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Want to see them?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.22,0:02:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like the kid made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.80,0:02:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but he's a strange one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.54,0:02:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This little rugrat was born\Nwith his eyes wide open.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.24,0:02:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But the really bizarre thing\Nis, he hasn't cried at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.34,0:03:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I don't have to tell you,\Nthis is no place for a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.26,0:03:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll have to be adopted.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.52,0:03:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So, where are you from, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.94,0:03:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Sardinia.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.98,0:03:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,In time, the child was taken in\Nby a village priest on the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.96,0:03:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Time seemed to fly by,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.96,0:03:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,and over the years, the young boy gained\Na reputation for his bashful naivete.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.40,0:03:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I better get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.16,0:03:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,See you later, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.08,0:03:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Froggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.52,0:03:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch where you're going, you brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.04,0:03:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's just you again!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.92,0:03:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of the road, Katsone!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.52,0:03:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't blabber the padre!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.62,0:03:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez, they were mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.56,0:03:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But still, I'm glad you're\Nokay, my little amico.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.40,0:03:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You like frogs, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.42,0:03:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I do, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.94,0:03:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can't stand bugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.74,0:04:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not too fond of\Nfunky-smelling guys, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.46,0:04:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate anything that isn't beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.00,0:04:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You from around here, or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.70,0:04:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah, I guess I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.90,0:04:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, uh, would you like\Nsomething cold to drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.70,0:04:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, well, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.64,0:04:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess it couldn't hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.50,0:04:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So how does sparkling water sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.00,0:04:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, French mineral water.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.60,0:04:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Your treat, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.86,0:04:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to become a sailor? I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.34,0:04:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.24,0:04:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially for a simple\Nsoul like yours. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.44,0:04:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe you'll make a wonderful mariner.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.52,0:04:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.50,0:04:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The fact that he walked all\Nthe way here is impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.80,0:04:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Good on the lad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.36,0:05:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose it's time he had a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.34,0:05:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanting to build a carport\Nnext to the boy's room,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.16,0:05:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,the priest began digging up the\Nfloor tiles and underlying concrete.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.62,0:05:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.10,0:05:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,A corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.52,0:05:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.20,0:05:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He carefully chiseled away at the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.88,0:05:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Until he uncovered her, the woman\Nwho gave birth to his adopted son.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.74,0:05:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,She's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.84,0:05:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,She was paralyzed and unable to speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.90,0:05:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But something was keeping her\Ntethered to the world of the living.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.90,0:05:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,She lay buried for years, her mind\Nvacant with no conception of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.76,0:05:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether by hatred or love, her heart\Nhad been obfuscated by darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.34,0:05:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The hair is the same color as...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.48,0:06:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That night, a horrific\Nfire ravaged the village,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.00,0:06:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,strengthened by the night's howling winds.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.16,0:06:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,While no cause could be found, Seven died,\Nwhile countless others remained missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.04,0:06:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Among those listed on the\Ncoroner's report were the
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.48,0:06:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,village priest and the adopted\Nson he loved so dearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.54,0:06:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Why you... Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.38,0:06:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.62,0:06:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.60,0:06:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shut up. I'm not dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.96,0:06:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a truck bearing down, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.88,0:06:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.84,0:06:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Go take your Sunday stroll somewhere\Nelse, you freakin' Straizo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.50,0:07:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, that hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.60,0:07:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.16,0:07:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't seem to be your day, huh, kiddo?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.16,0:07:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Or am I sensing more of a\Nrough patch in your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.18,0:07:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're one hell of a psychic, because\NI've got nothing but problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.80,0:07:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you be interested\Nin hearing your fortune?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.28,0:07:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It comes at a special rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.76,0:07:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.67,0:07:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, thanks, but no.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.59,0:07:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sardinia is the locale of your\Nbirth, isn't that correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.14,0:07:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only that,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.32,0:07:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,but you haven't been back to the old\Nstomping grounds in quite some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.44,0:07:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not exactly fortune-telling.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.90,0:07:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course you can tell I'm\Nvisiting from out of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.56,0:07:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,My outfit is a total giveaway.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.12,0:07:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear Ragazzo, you harbor\Na great secret within you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.00,0:07:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,A shadow in the sun, two sides of a coin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.76,0:08:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You, child, lead two\Nentirely dissimilar lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.50,0:08:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Moreover,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.41,0:08:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,you take advantage of\Nyour harrowing secret,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.34,0:08:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,which combined with your\Ntenacious personality
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.60,0:08:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,has earned you a great many victories.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.40,0:08:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.42,0:08:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, scusi, I spoke out of turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.68,0:08:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Please understand, your face is very\Nbeguiling to a fortune teller like myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.54,0:08:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me the honor of\Ntelling your fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.50,0:08:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Twenty, no, ten thousand lira will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.40,0:08:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, sir, who among us doesn't\Nhave one secret or another?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.00,0:08:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,All of this stuff could apply to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.32,0:08:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You're searching for somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.38,0:08:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.36,0:08:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This person is very important to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.64,0:08:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That is so true.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.30,0:08:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't all of us just looking for\Nsomeone who's important to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.48,0:08:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We're desperate for the perfect\Npartner or faultless friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.14,0:08:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, it's kind of fun\Nhaving someone guess your future.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.06,0:08:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you do that anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.80,0:08:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,With that crystal ball? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.16,0:08:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already begun by other means.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.86,0:09:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,For example, the mud on your\Ntrousers tells me a great deal. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.52,0:09:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The Romani have practiced\Nthis divination for millennia.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.78,0:09:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The spontaneity of nature holds powers\Ngreater than our wildest imaginations.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.32,0:09:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That splatter is a symbol of\Nmankind's fate. Your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.56,0:09:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, the person who you've come all\Nthis way to find is your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.50,0:09:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You've returned to Sardinia\Nto find the child you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.74,0:09:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,fathered with the woman you\Nleft behind 15 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.68,0:09:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.90,0:09:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.81,0:09:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Very strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.26,0:09:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Your youthfulness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.68,0:09:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I just uttered those\Nwords, but I'm completely baffled.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.26,0:09:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'm a father?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.66,0:09:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.57,0:09:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.49,0:09:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm quite certain of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.40,0:09:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I must read your palm. Hey. I beg of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.50,0:09:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,My worth is a fortune\Nteller hinges on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.82,0:09:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.73,0:09:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want your money.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.65,0:09:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, I'll pay you. Twenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.46,0:09:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,A hundred thousand lira.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.94,0:09:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm bleeding here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.26,0:09:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave me the hell alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.10,0:09:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare touch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.50,0:09:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So what if you could predict the future?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.48,0:10:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That ability will be useless\Nto you once you're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.80,0:10:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.10,0:10:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Your face?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.44,0:10:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems you're not a stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.52,0:10:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Pity you've had to peddle\Nyour talents of perception
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.58,0:10:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,on the side of the road\Nlike a common beggar.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.46,0:10:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It was the greatest misstep of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.04,0:10:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, Divine,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.98,0:10:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,anyone who possesses any knowledge of my\Ntrue self must not be allowed to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.14,0:10:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But you have proven yourself to be a\Nfortune teller of the highest caliber.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.94,0:10:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You've my admiration,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.60,0:10:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,so I shall kill you in a way that\Ninflicts the least amount of pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.52,0:10:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But my generosity comes with a price.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.76,0:10:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The traitor in this picture\Nis known as Risotto.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.66,0:10:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He desires to reveal my true identity,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.40,0:10:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,and has made it his mission\Nto seek out my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.92,0:10:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Use your divination to\Nreveal this man's location.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.90,0:10:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You want his location?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.48,0:11:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I can't say, though I'm\Nsure you'll encounter him soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.50,0:11:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He has come to Sardinia.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.74,0:11:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,His heart burns with revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.02,0:11:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no question your paths will cross.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.62,0:11:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.44,0:11:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That will suffice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.10,0:11:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.26,0:11:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew I was right about your nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.30,0:11:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's truly like two sides of a coin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.56,0:11:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a dual personality.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.16,0:11:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you bear this secret,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.92,0:11:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,the death of others\Nwill be your fortune and
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.70,0:11:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,eternal glory will spring\Nforth from your fingertips.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.76,0:11:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, your glorious palm\Nglows with stunning beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.28,0:11:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Never have I seen a hand so handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.60,0:11:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.38,0:11:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything looks different.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.96,0:11:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't how the lifeline was at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.82,0:11:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.06,0:11:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm holding my own severed hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.78,0:11:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Now how did that happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.60,0:11:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Emperor Crimson.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.02,0:12:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.78,0:12:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you weren't flattened.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.76,0:12:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This is no place for a guy like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.04,0:12:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on now, get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.56,0:12:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful out there, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.64,0:12:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Where to, Signore?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.60,0:12:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Costa Smeralda, please. Cierto.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.24,0:12:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Our next story comes to us from Sardinia,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.06,0:12:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,where the investigation of an airplane\Ncrash near the city of Olvia continues,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.36,0:12:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,despite a strong effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.76,0:13:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Scusi, would you happen to\Nhave a phone I could use?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.04,0:13:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Mine's totally broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.92,0:13:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I don't, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.42,0:13:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.80,0:13:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.71,0:13:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Driver, stop the taxi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.80,0:13:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to get out, and here\Nis as good a spot as any.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.44,0:13:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.88,0:13:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.52,0:13:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,All I have to do is keep\Nan eye on that spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.96,0:13:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The Costa Smeralda of Sardinia.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.20,0:13:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Just over a half a century ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.56,0:13:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,before the beauty of its waters and shore\Ncaught the eyes of an Indian magnet,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.76,0:13:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,the secluded locale was practically\Nunknown to the outside world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.36,0:13:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.50,0:13:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I think your meter may be off by a digit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.10,0:13:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see how it is You're accusing me\Nof ripping you off by rigging the meter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.90,0:13:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that what you're saying, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.24,0:13:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No, but 800,000 lira to go from town to\Nhere seems a bit much I don't have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.84,0:13:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Like someone coming\Nhere doesn't have cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.46,0:14:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't think I didn't see you hiding\Nsomething when you were back there
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.38,0:14:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, I saw you stashing\Nan envelope in your pants
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.50,0:14:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.41,0:14:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't trick me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.86,0:14:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't touch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.18,0:14:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,My head! You see? Bingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.22,0:14:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.64,0:14:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You should've kept those\Npeepers to yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.60,0:14:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Your damn curiosity's\Nabout to get you killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.50,0:14:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You're insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.82,0:14:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait. Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.44,0:14:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.70,0:14:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The phone rang.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.42,0:14:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, answer the damn question.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.74,0:14:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No way that busted up phone\Nwas ringing, so what gives?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.10,0:14:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you're even talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.14,0:14:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,There it is again. Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.30,0:14:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.28,0:14:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So you do have a working phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.64,0:14:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been holding out on me, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.06,0:15:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.88,0:15:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.79,0:15:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.71,0:15:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's Dopio.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.50,0:15:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss, yes, I just arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.64,0:15:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Same spot as the photo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.80,0:15:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,So all I've got to do is\Nkeep an eye out, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.40,0:15:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.38,0:15:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So because he didn't get a good look at\Nwhat was inside, he's allowed to live?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.76,0:15:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.67,0:15:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to question your infinite wisdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.68,0:15:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,boss, but I'm pretty positive the driver\Nsaw something he shouldn't have seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.84,0:15:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, my apologies, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.06,0:15:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already begun keeping\Nwatch over the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.14,0:15:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you're watching the building?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.66,0:15:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd reevaluate, Dopio.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.04,0:15:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Look harder, but move slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.42,0:15:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Make no sudden movements.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.08,0:15:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You must not appear flustered.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.22,0:15:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The one who's being watched\Nright now is you, Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.06,0:15:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.97,0:15:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Risotto.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.00,0:15:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He's one of the traitors\Nfrom the Hitman team.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.40,0:15:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That Indovino was right. There he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.30,0:16:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He's certainly a crafty one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.30,0:16:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The plane crash managed to tip him off to\Nthe photo of Sardinia from Trish's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.34,0:16:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Our first order of business\Nis to take him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.30,0:16:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, he'll be even more\Ntrouble once Trish arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.74,0:16:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Just leave the killing blow to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.76,0:16:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.94,0:16:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Your job is to close the distance between\Nus without revealing your true identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.12,0:16:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Even I have no insight\Ninto Risotto's abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.04,0:16:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Lure him within two meters of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.38,0:16:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I need the fool well within\NEmperor Crimson's range.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.72,0:16:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'll leave it to you. Ciao, Doppio.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.08,0:16:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Adeu, mi caro. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.04,0:16:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You can count on me, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.54,0:16:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.78,0:16:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,My head is killing me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.14,0:16:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, that's the least of my worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.70,0:16:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The boss just called with a direct order.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.78,0:16:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to keep an eye on the\Nbuilding and then I need to...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.68,0:16:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,To...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.74,0:16:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What did he say? Close the gap?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.08,0:16:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. Move in closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.82,0:17:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, but closer to what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.04,0:17:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't happen, so don't stress.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.62,0:17:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.02,0:17:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.34,0:17:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I've seen that face before.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.78,0:17:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.42,0:17:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Move your hand away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.96,0:17:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to see your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.42,0:17:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, sir, I don't have any money.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.06,0:17:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.32,0:17:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh man, why does this\Nalways have to happen to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.46,0:17:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.88,0:17:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This coward doesn't have the\Nfaintest clue what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.90,0:17:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,He's pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.38,0:17:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,No one from Passione\Nwould behave like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.06,0:17:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, he's practically\Nbegging to be attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.06,0:17:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like he's just your\Nrun-of-the-mill brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.72,0:17:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.94,0:17:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it a rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.88,0:17:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just grabbing my knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.48,0:18:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You're of no interest\Nto me now. I don't feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.06,0:18:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,so good my head is aching yeah two meters
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.06,0:18:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,that's right and now that I'm remembering\Nyou did do something kind of fishy back
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.90,0:18:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,there when you tripped and fell on your\Nface you almost reflexively hid the envelope
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.20,0:18:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,on the ground I'm pretty sure I saw you\Nhide it under your foot So what's inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.10,0:18:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's nothing, I'll be on my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.56,0:18:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.08,0:18:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I told you I'm broke!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.16,0:18:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let me go in peace!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.62,0:18:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I sense no bloodlust or hostility.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.92,0:18:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But still, I know a liar when I see one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.32,0:18:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up and show me what\Nyou're hiding underfoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.14,0:18:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I said up, damn it! Hop to!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.88,0:18:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh shit, it is just an envelope.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.58,0:19:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The thing's totally empty. Guess\Nthe groveling wasn't an act after.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.12,0:19:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,all you're just a coward who can't\Nlie to save his life that said
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.78,0:19:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,everything's changed you intrigue\Nme more and more every second i
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.66,0:19:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,have no doubt you're a stand user\Nyou also heard that sound didn't you
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.22,0:19:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,just now you made a\Nstealthy glance towards
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.78,0:19:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,that whirring noise\Nsomeone's combing the place
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.50,0:19:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,They're carrying out a\Nreconnaissance mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.06,0:19:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That could only be one stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.78,0:19:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Will Bomber!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.86,0:19:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,They finally made it to Sardinia!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.94,0:19:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Well now, you'd have to be very\Nspecial to be sent to this location.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.78,0:19:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Clearly the boss has a\Ntremendous deal of faith in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.08,0:19:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite all that, your\Nfear's 100 % genuine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.90,0:19:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You are quite the\Nfascinating contradiction!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.82,0:19:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop talking!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.96,0:19:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The only one who's going to be\Nquaking with fear is you, Stronzo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.68,0:19:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.66,0:19:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're charging ahead tells me\Nyou're a close-range user with power.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.02,0:20:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Your range is two or three\Nmeters, as long as I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.90,0:20:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Killing you is easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.50,0:20:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.02,0:20:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,My throat!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.98,0:20:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.88,0:20:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Are these actual razor blades?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.72,0:20:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I just need to get within two\Nmeters of this edgy douche.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.90,0:20:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I do, I'll jam these\Nblades straight up his ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.44,0:20:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I said, I know just how to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.22,0:20:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, that hurt, but you're still dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.86,0:20:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.30,0:20:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.82,0:20:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That's his special ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.96,0:20:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But how am I supposed to...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.32,0:20:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I heard a phone ringing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.26,0:21:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.68,0:21:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Who would ever guess there'd be\Na payphone all the way out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.98,0:21:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.40,0:21:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,My doppio.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.94,0:21:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I need your help with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.82,0:21:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No, the time is not yet right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.34,0:21:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Until you close the gap between\Nthe two of you, I cannot act.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.22,0:21:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If he catches sight of me\Nand manages to get away,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.60,0:21:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,all our efforts will have been for naught.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.10,0:21:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But boss...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.24,0:21:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.54,0:21:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Move within two meters of risotto.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.34,0:21:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss, I still have no\Nidea how his powers work.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.44,0:21:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just gonna get me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.96,0:21:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Doppio.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.24,0:21:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear Doppio.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.56,0:21:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,My sweet, charming Doppio.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.72,0:21:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you so easily\Nforgotten that I bestowed
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.22,0:21:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,you with part of Emperor Crimson's power?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.56,0:21:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Now's your chance to\Napply your unique talents.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.72,0:22:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,To tell us what's bad and\Nwhat's good. Stand up,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.44,0:22:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,join us Come on,
